-- Further laws of the greatest common divisor: units and self, order bounds,
-- shifting by multiples, subtraction, distributivity over a common factor,
-- associativity, consecutive numbers, and coprimality under products and
-- powers
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
